<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 6.821 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 6.821 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico placed two of five credits whereby it sought to inject 6.821 billion pesos in the secondary market on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM     MAXIMUM   MINIMUM   AVERAGE</p>
<p>    1.456 bln  11 days  32.50     32.26     32.38</p>
<p>    1.455 bln   7 days  32.30     32.11     32.20</p>
<p>    1.455 bln   5 days</p>
<p>    1.455 bln   4 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   3 days</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos, maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
